WEBVTT

00:00.440 --> 00:06.120
Have the volunteers camp outside the city for now Your Highness this is cautious.

00:06.720 --> 00:08.387
But may chill their hearts.

00:10.160 --> 00:13.707
Look at their flags there are several fortresses alone.

00:14.800 --> 00:19.093
This is a mixed bag can't guarantee there are no Wuzhao spies.

00:19.480 --> 00:25.160
They only need to organize a hundred people to cause chaos in the city then seize the gates.

00:25.960 --> 00:27.360
And we're finished.

00:29.480 --> 00:30.840
What's the delay?

00:30.920 --> 00:36.480
Let us in. Yes, yes, yes brother-in-law these northern volunteers.

00:36.560 --> 00:42.920
Are mostly bandits in daily life their tempers are worse than each other few are presentable.

00:43.840 --> 00:47.400
If we don't reassure them they'll probably turn around and leave.

